.TH __riscv_flush_icache 3 2026\-02\-08 "Linux man\-pages (未リリース)" 
.SH 名前
__riscv_flush_icache \- Flush icaches on RISC\-V
.SH ライブラリ
標準 C ライブラリ (\fIlibc\fP,\~\fI\-lc\fP)
.SH 書式
.nf
\fB#include <sys/cachectl.h>\fP
.P
\fBint __riscv_flush_icache(void *start, void *end, unsigned long flags);\fP
.fi
.SH 説明
\fB__riscv_flush_icache\fP()  enforces ordering between stores and instruction
cache fetches.
.P
The range of addresses over which ordering is enforced is specified by
\fIstart\fP and \fIend\fP.
.P
The \fIflags\fP argument controls the extent of this ordering, with the default
behavior (a \fIflags\fP value of 0)  being to enforce the fence on all threads
in the current process.  Setting the \fBSYS_RISCV_FLUSH_ICACHE_LOCAL\fP bit
allows users to indicate that enforcing ordering on only the current thread
is necessary.  All other bits in \fIflags\fP are reserved.
.SH 標準規格
Linux on RISC\-V.
.SH 歴史
Linux 4.15.  glibc 2.27.
.SH 関連項目
 \fBsyscall\fP(2)
